# Go

- Run `go test` on affected packages only unless asked for full suite.
- Follow existing error wrapping (`fmt.Errorf` with `%w`, `errors.Join`, etc.).
- Do not add modules to `go.mod` without approval.
- Match receiver and interface patterns used in the same package.
- Avoid `panic` for expected errors; reserve for programmer bugs as the repo does.
- Keep exported symbols documented only if siblings are documented.
- Respect `context.Context` as first parameter when the package already does.
